  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Xia clan Gu Immortals note that Wu clan did not send Wu Yu Bo or Wu Zhen to Frosty Peak. Xia Zhuo Mo explains Wu Zhen is busy defending Phoenix Peak while phoenix birds produce their eggs there.",
      "chapters": [
        1306
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "char_wu_yu_bo",
        "loc_frosty_peak",
        "char_xia_zhuo_mo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia analysis later repeats that when the phoenix birds finish laying, Wu Zhen will be free to come and change the negotiation.",
      "chapters": [
        1308
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Wu Yong recovers Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian, Wu Zhen stands behind him on the corpse mountain peak. Wu Yong calls the place strategic and says that among the clansmen he can only be at ease handing it to Wu Zhen. Wu Zhen answers that he will not disappoint first supreme elder, accepts the order to recuperate rather than expand, and cheers Wu Yong’s plan to take resources as compensation.",
      "chapters": [
        1438
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-emperor-post",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian has high productivity and strategic position, Wu Yong stations rank seven Gu Immortal Wu Zhen there. When Fierce Gorge Seven Ghosts assault the cardinal directional wind formation over the Corpse Emperor true inheritance, they threaten Wu Zhen’s life and urge betrayal. Wu Zhen controls the formation from outside while riddled with wounds until Wu Yong arrives through the formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-garrison",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_corpse_emperor_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He puts away the cardinal directional wind formation in excitement, analyzes Lu Wei Yin’s possible hand behind the seven ghosts, and at first hesitates that attacking Mushroomman Paradise is early while super forces chase qi tide inheritances. The thought of fighting Fang Yuan turns his face pale, yet after Wu Yong’s guidance he agrees to the mushroomman expedition.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "loc_mushroomman_paradise",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Wu Ji’s immortal ascension under raging tribulations, Wu Zhen controls the situation for Wu clan, feels her strength path aura after she breaks the qi cocoon, and sighs that she chose strength path after all.",
      "chapters": [
        2121
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-ji-ascension",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_empress_wu_ji"
      ]
    }
  ],
